{"sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","items":[{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k001","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"엽록체 thylakoid 막의 광계 II는 물을 산화해 O₂와 전자를 만들고 전자 전달로 H⁺ 기울기를 형성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k002","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"광계 I은 전자를 재여기시키고 ferredoxin을 거쳐 NADP⁺ 환원을 유도한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k003","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"ATP synthase는 H⁺ 기울기를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k004","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"순환적 광인산화는 주로 ATP를 생성하고 순 NADPH·O₂ 생성은 없다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k005","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"Calvin 회로는 stroma에서 Rubisco에 의해 CO₂를 RuBP에 고정하고 ATP/NADPH를 사용해 triose phosphate를 만든다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k006","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"CO₂ 3개 고정으로 순 G3P 한 분자를 만들 때 보통 ATP 9개와 NADPH 6개가 필요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k007","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"Rubisco의 oxygenase 활성은 광호흡을 시작하며 높은 온도와 낮은 CO₂/O₂ 비에서 커질 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k008","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"C4 식물은 엽육세포에서 PEP carboxylase로 CO₂를 고정하고 유관속초세포에서 농축한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k009","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"CAM 식물은 밤과 낮의 시간적 분리를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k010","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"광반응: thylakoid, Calvin 회로: stroma.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k011","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"O₂는 CO₂가 아니라 H₂O에서 유래한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k012","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"C4는 공간적, CAM은 시간적 탄소고정 분리.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k013","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"Rubisco는 carboxylase와 oxygenase 활성을 모두 가진다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--photosynthesis-k014","sectionId":"plant/photosynthesis","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"ATP 18개와 NADPH 12개이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}